{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "미타?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "아, 벌써 일어났어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "여기는 또 어떻게 온 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "방금 전까지 내 옆에 있었잖아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "아니요"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "거울 앞에서 멈춰있길래."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "먼저 나왔어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "그 방은 뭐였어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "구조를 좀 바꿨어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "당신이 더 편하게 다닐 수 있게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "이렇게 하니까"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "방들이 일렬로 있진 않지만"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "원래 모습으로 돌아온 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "굳이 그럴 필요 없어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "이제 좀 익숙해졌는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "이게 더 편할 것 같았어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "그럼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "게임을 시작할까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "룰을 간단히 설명할게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "칩에 이번 라운드에서 비교할 스탯이 표시돼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "생명력 같은 거죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "그다음 카드를 내면 되는데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "카드의 생명력이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "제 카드보다"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "높으면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "이기는 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "카드를 뽑아보세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "이제 제 차례네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "와!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "좋은 카드가 나왔어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "제가 먼저 낼게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "이제 당신 차례예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "카드를 내주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "음~"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "이제 당신 차례예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "이번엔 생명력 승부예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "이번엔 공격력 대결이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "이번엔 방어력을 볼게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "완전 실력자!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "대단해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "이번엔 제가 졌네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "아, 져버렸다…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "제가 이겼어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "이겼다아!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "예이~ 승리!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "헤헤, 제가 이겼어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "비겼네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "막상막하예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "무승부예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "수치가 똑같네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// The card game is interrupted"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "방금 그 소리 들었어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "옷장에서 나는 것 같은데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "소리요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "무슨 소리?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "전 아무 소리도 못 들었는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "어떤 소리였어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "노크 소리 같아. 마치 누가 안에 있는 것처럼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "하지만 저기…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "아무것도 없을 텐데요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "직접 확인해 봐야겠어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "뭔가 너무 수상해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "왜 자꾸…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "또 이렇게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "뭐 하시는 거예요!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "저기 안에는…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "제 속옷이 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "뭔가 숨기고 있는 거지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "저를 의심하는 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "제가 뭘 잘못했나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "전 그저…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "당신과 함께 있고 싶었을 뿐인데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "그래, 같이 있어 줄게. 그래서 뭘 하고 싶은데?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "그렇게까지… 옷장이 궁금하신가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "난 그냥 그 소리가 궁금할 뿐이야!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "그게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "이 세계에는"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "이 네 개의 방이 전부예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "이 정도면 충분하지 않나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "그냥 제 곁에 있어 주면 안 되나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Don't stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "알겠어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "또 이렇게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "진실이 궁금한가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "좋아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "전부 보여드릴게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "이건…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "가끔 이런 일이 생겨요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "방이 아직 로딩이 안 된 거예요"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "잠시만 기다려 주세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "이상하네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "우리가 누구 폰 안에 있는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "구식 핸드폰이라도 쓰나?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "아니요"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "그냥 이 세계에서는"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "모든 게 완벽하지 않아서…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "우리가 로딩되는 건"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "이 세계의 코어가 제어하거든요"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "코어라고?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "흔한 설정 아닌가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "아, 맞다!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "콘솔 게임도 할 수 있고,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "카드 게임도 할 수 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "어떤 거 해볼래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "한판 붙어볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "저를 네 번만"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "이기면 돼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "시작해 볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "물론 처음엔"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "봐 드릴게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "대단해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "이제부터가 진짜예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "와!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "좋아요, 이제부터"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "절대 안 봐 드려요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "우와!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "이제 과연"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "절 이길 수 있을까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "말도 안돼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "완전"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "고수잖아요! 혹시 프로게이머…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "일부러 져주는 건 아니죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "너무 티 나요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "흐음"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "게임 오버! 운도 실력이라고요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "자자~"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "절 이기려면 진심으로 해야 될 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "아니, 이게 뭐예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "그렇게 대충 하면 절대 못 이긴다고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "진짜 실력을 보여주세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "저도 열심히 연습한 거라고요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "그럼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "카드 게임이 있는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "제 방에서 한 판 할까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Door > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "무슨 일이야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "여기는 대체…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "앗…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "죄송해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "제가 인터넷에서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "파일 하나 다운받았거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "창밖 풍경을"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "더 예쁘게 만들고 싶어서요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "근데 이게"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "파일 형식이 안 맞나 봐요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "나중에 다시 수정할게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "그래서 우리가 이 방을 못 나가는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "아… 그런 거였어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "으음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "왜 그러세요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "뭐 하시려고요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Wall Clock"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "이 시계"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "무슨 시간이 표시되는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "게임 시간?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "아니면 스마트폰이랑 연동된 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "글쎄요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "저도 잘 모르겠어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "사실 시간은 중요하지 않아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "늦어도 상관없죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "집에서 저와 함께 있다면…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "전 특별한 사람이라"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "피곤한 건 모르거든요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "제가 원하면 여기는 영원히 봄이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "해도 영원히 지지 않는다고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "신기하긴 한데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "왠지 소름 돋아"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "시간이 영원히 한 순간에 멈춰있다니…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Photos of Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "사진 완전 잘 나왔네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "여기 찍힌 여자애가 너야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "맞아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "제가 엄청 아끼는 사진이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "근데 누가 찍어준 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "이 세계에 다른 사람도 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "있다고 할 수도 있죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "소개해 드릴 수도 있는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "지금은 때가 아니에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "함께 있는 시간이 너무 좋아서, 아직은 다른 사람한테 뺏기고 싶지 않아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "장치가 없어졌네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "포탈이었어? 아니면 도대체 뭐야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "제가"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "마법으로"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "잠시 다른 곳에"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "보관해 뒀어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "이제 그런 건 필요 없어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "우리를 방해할 수도 있거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Mirror in the bedroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "거울에 내가 안 비치네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "뭔가 진짜 이상해…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "거울 반사 기능을 켜면 돼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "원하신다면요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "한번 켜볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "응, 켜줘."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "잠깐… 이거 켜면 뭐가 달라져?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "그럼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "움직임이 느려지고 렉이 생길 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "프레임이 낮은 애니메이션 보신 적 있나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "계속 그런 식으로 될 텐데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "알겠어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "그냥 이대로 두자…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "[player]님…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "거울 보는 거 좋아하시나 봐요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "혹시… 자신의 얼굴에서 행복한 표정이 보이는 게 무서운가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "뭐? 그런 거 아닌데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "그냥 피곤해서 그래"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "요즘 일이 너무 힘들어서…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Blue sneakers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "이거 네 신발이야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "아뇨, 이건 당신 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "벌써 잊었나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "난 이런 운동화 산 적 없는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "이제 있네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "나중에 같이 산책할 때"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "신으면 되죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "그럼 옷은 어떡하지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "여기 오면서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "지금 입은 옷밖에 없는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "다른 옷은 어떻게 구해?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "걱정 마세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "그동안 제가 봐온 결과,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "패션 센스가 좀 아쉽더라고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "괜찮아요, 제가 다 준비해 둘게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "나중에 천천히요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "약속할게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "그래."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Games on TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "흐음, 뭐 할까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "이 게임에서 한판 붙어볼까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "누구 요구르트가 더 새콤한지 보자고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "완전 재밌겠죠!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "사워밀크 게임은 이제 질렸어요, 다른 거 할까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "이 게임에선 펭귄이 되어서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "얼음 위를 달리면 돼요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "이것도 해본 거네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "아… 정말요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "진심인 거예요? 전…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "너무 행복해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "그럼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "영원히 제 곁에 있어 줄 수 있나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "영원히요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// A game about penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "룰은 간단해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "눈덩이를 모으면 되는데요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "누가 더 많이 모으나 대결이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "그럼, 두 판만 해볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// The first map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "우와, 이렇게나 많이 찾았어요?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "헤헷! 전 더 많이 모았네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "어서 따라와 보세요~"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "와우, 1대1이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// The second map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "펭귄이 환생한 거 아니에요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "실제로 얼음 위에서 미끄러져 보는 건 어때요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "푸핫, 너무 느려요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "지난 라운드의 충격이 크셨나봐요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "후… 무승부라니, 이런 적은 처음이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// The game is over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "게임 한 판 더 할래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "아니면 오늘은 여기까지 할까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "어머, 그건 뭐예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "어서 게임에서 빠져나오세요!"}
